# Client JVM options: NetBeans project Properties > Run > VM Options.
# These are capture/sender targets, not measured quality or throughput.
-Dmmr.screen.width=1280
-Dmmr.screen.height=720
-Dmmr.screen.fps=10
-Dmmr.screen.bitrate=1800000
# Supported bounded ranges: width 320..1280, height 240..720, fps 1..15,
# bitrate 200000..5000000 bit/s. Renderer mailboxes are bounded to 1280x720.
